      <activity id="2f43a593-0c38-51d7-bbcc-2326564e4af8" activityNameId="b155fb26-98fb-58d2-aa1a-a3938c714037" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, production PL, at long-distance pipeline</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, production PL, at long-distance pipeline
In 2023 100% of the imported Polish natural gas to RoE was imported by pipeline and 0% as LNG. An average distance of 0 km is estimated for the pipeline export from Poland, of which are 0 km offshore pipeline. The estimated shipping distance for LNG are 0 km. The net calorific value of natural is 36.0 MJ/Nm³. UUID=30a38e11-a2c4-31b4-a50b-6fb4b0cae444
This dataset describes the transport needed for an average export of Polish natural gas. Gas losses and emissions during seasonal storage are included.
Location: The data for storage emissions are based on global data. The amount of gas stored is a rough estimate based on European data. The average weighted transport distance is based on the trade movements 2019.
Technology: The distance is an European average based on the European long-distance pipeline network and LNG shipping routes.
Time period: Transport modes investigated for 2023.
Production volume: not known
Sampling: Literature.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_30a38e11-a2c4-31b4-a50b-6fb4b0cae444.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
